// Lesson plans for English for Marketing Communication (ESP, CEFR B1-B1+): one 90-minute class per week.
// Each teaching unit follows the genre-based cycle (build the field, deconstruct a model text, joint then independent
// construction) with a task-based speaking stage. The renderer embeds the unit's real items into these stages.
// Timing rationale: B1 reading about 100 words a minute plus about 1 minute per question; listening played twice;
// writing about 6-8 words a minute including planning; each lesson sums to 85-95 minutes.

